--[[
	2014 Roblox Voxel Terrain Converter v12 (Plastic Edition)
	Same engine as the 2013 converter (exact edits, section rebuilds, fast loading), but:
	   - Parts use regular Plastic instead of SmoothPlastic.
	   - Faces use the 2014 terrain textures.

	Adding the 2014 textures (either way works):
	   A) Put the PNG files in your executor's workspace folder under "Voxel2014", named after the keys
	      below, e.g. workspace/Voxel2014/Grass.png, workspace/Voxel2014/Sand.png ...
	   B) Paste each PNG as base64 into EMBEDDED_TEXTURES_B64 below.
	   Keys: Grass, Dirt, Sand, Brick, Granite, Asphalt, IronPlate, AluminumPlate, WoodPlanks, Logs,
	         Gravel, Cinderblock, MossyRock, Concrete
	   A material with no texture just shows its plain Plastic colour.
]]

